## What the Project is
This project is an automated spreadsheet-based ETL Workflow.
It automatically extracts, transforms, and organizes many different types of part numbers into ascending order.
It then loads the sorted list into one of three reports that can then be priinted out.
These reports are used for the planning and moving of hundreds of parts at a time, to differnt locations in the warehouse.


## The Problem
It would take over an hour to manually cut and paste the data into ascending order, and is repetitive and error-prone.
A repeatable process w sneeded to transform the source data into standardized, usable reports.
Source files could potentially arrive with inconsistent formatting/structure.
This would need to be a minimal interaction solution, due to potential non-technical users being involved.


